---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
    title="Affiliate Disclosure | Findable Home"
    description="Learn how Findable Home affiliate links and commissions work, how product recommendations are approached, and how commercial relationships are disclosed."
>
    <main class="min-h-screen bg-base-200/40">
        <header class="border-b border-base-300 bg-base-100">
            <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 sm:py-16 lg:px-8">
                <div class="max-w-3xl">
                    <span class="inline-flex items-center rounded-full border border-primary/20 bg-primary/10 px-4 py-1.5 text-sm font-semibold text-primary">
                        OUR POLICIES
                    </span>
                    <h1 class="mt-5 text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-base-content sm:text-5xl">
                        Affiliate Disclosure
                    </h1>
                    <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-base-content/70">
                        Clear information about how Findable Home may earn
                        commissions and how commercial relationships relate
                        to our household recommendations.
                    </p>
                    <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3 text-sm text-base-content/70">
                        <span class="rounded-lg bg-base-200 px-3 py-2">Effective: October 10, 2026</span>
                        <span class="rounded-lg bg-base-200 px-3 py-2">Updated: October 10, 2026</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mt-8 h-1 w-20 rounded-full bg-secondary"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </header>

        <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl grid-cols-1 items-start gap-8 px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 lg:grid-cols-[240px_minmax(0,1fr)] lg:px-8 lg:py-14">
            <aside class="lg:sticky lg:top-6">
                <nav aria-label="Affiliate disclosure contents" class="rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-5 shadow-sm">
                    <h2 class="text-base font-bold">On this page</h2>
                    <ul class="mt-4 space-y-1 text-sm">
                        <li><a class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-base-content/75 hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-primary" href="#disclosure">1. The disclosure</a></li>
                        <li><a class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-base-content/75 hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-primary" href="#affiliate-links">2. Affiliate links</a></li>
                        <li><a class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-base-content/75 hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-primary" href="#benable">3. Benable and other partners</a></li>
                        <li><a class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-base-content/75 hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-primary" href="#recommendations">4. Product recommendations</a></li>
                        <li><a class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-base-content/75 hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-primary" href="#cost">5. Your cost</a></li>
                        <li><a class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-base-content/75 hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-primary" href="#accuracy">6. Product details</a></li>
                        <li><a class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-base-content/75 hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-primary" href="#advertising">7. Advertising</a></li>
                        <li><a class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-base-content/75 hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-primary" href="#independence">8. Editorial independence</a></li>
                        <li><a class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-base-content/75 hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-primary" href="#third-parties">9. Third-party websites</a></li>
                        <li><a class="block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-base-content/75 hover:bg-primary/10 hover:text-primary" href="#contact">10. Contact</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </nav>
            </aside>

            <div class="min-w-0 space-y-5 text-base-content">
                <section id="disclosure" class="scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-base-300 border-l-4 border-l-primary bg-base-100 p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">1. Our Affiliate Disclosure</h2>
                    <p class="mt-3 leading-7">
                        Findable Home may participate in affiliate marketing
                        programs. This means some links on our website or in
                        our product collections may be affiliate links. If you
                        click one and complete a qualifying purchase or action,
                        we may receive a commission.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        We provide this disclosure so you can understand our
                        commercial relationships when evaluating our content
                        and recommendations. We aim to make affiliate
                        relationships clear and disclose them in a way that
                        readers can notice and understand.
                    </p>
                    <div class="mt-5 rounded-xl border border-secondary/40 bg-secondary/10 p-5">
                        <p class="font-bold">In simple terms</p>
                        <p class="mt-2 leading-7">
                            Some links may earn us a commission if you make a
                            qualifying purchase. This generally does not
                            increase your purchase price.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </section>

                <section id="affiliate-links" class="scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">2. How Affiliate Links Work</h2>
                    <p class="mt-3 leading-7">
                        Affiliate links contain information that allows a
                        participating retailer, platform, or affiliate network
                        to associate a visit or qualifying action with a
                        referral. If the requirements of a program are met,
                        Findable Home may receive a commission or other
                        qualifying compensation.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        Not every link on Findable Home is necessarily an
                        affiliate link. The type of link and any available
                        compensation depend on the specific retailer, platform,
                        and program.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        Affiliate tracking and attribution are handled by the
                        relevant third-party service. Its terms and privacy
                        practices apply when you interact with that service.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section id="benable" class="scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">3. Benable and Other Commercial Partners</h2>
                    <p class="mt-3 leading-7">
                        Findable Home uses Benable to organize and share
                        product discoveries and curated product collections.
                        Some products or links shared through Benable may be
                        connected to affiliate programs or other commercial
                        relationships.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        Whether compensation is available depends on the
                        particular product, retailer, link, and applicable
                        program terms. We do not claim that every Benable
                        collection item or external link generates a commission.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        Other retailers, affiliate networks, or commercial
                        partners may be used in the future. We will aim to
                        disclose relevant relationships clearly when they apply.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        You can explore our curated product discoveries on
                        <a href="https://benable.com/CarolinaWilson" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="link link-primary">Benable</a>.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section id="recommendations" class="scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">4. How We Approach Product Recommendations</h2>
                    <p class="mt-3 leading-7">
                        Findable Home focuses on practical household problems,
                        including storage limitations, small spaces,
                        organization challenges, and renter-friendly solutions.
                        Product suggestions are intended to help readers
                        explore options that may suit a particular need.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        We aim to consider factors such as usefulness,
                        suitability, space requirements, installation
                        considerations, and the problem a product is intended
                        to address. A product's availability through an
                        affiliate program does not, by itself, establish that
                        it is the right choice for every reader.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        We do not guarantee that every recommendation will
                        work in every home. Individual needs, measurements,
                        budgets, preferences, and circumstances vary.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section id="cost" class="scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">5. Does Using an Affiliate Link Cost More?</h2>
                    <p class="mt-3 leading-7">
                        In ordinary affiliate arrangements, using an affiliate
                        link does not increase the price you pay. The retailer
                        or affiliate program pays the commission when its
                        qualifying conditions are met.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        However, the final price, shipping fees, taxes,
                        discounts, and other charges are determined by the
                        retailer. Always review the retailer's checkout total
                        and purchase terms before completing an order.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section id="accuracy" class="scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">6. Product Information and Availability</h2>
                    <p class="mt-3 leading-7">
                        Product prices, dimensions, specifications, materials,
                        colors, stock, shipping terms, warranties, and return
                        policies may change without notice. Product listings
                        and descriptions may also be updated or discontinued
                        by their providers.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        We encourage you to verify current details directly
                        with the retailer or manufacturer before purchasing.
                        Findable Home is not the seller of products simply
                        because we link to or discuss them.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section id="advertising" class="scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">7. Advertising and Other Compensation</h2>
                    <p class="mt-3 leading-7">
                        Findable Home may explore additional monetization
                        methods as the website develops. Google AdSense
                        advertising is not currently active as of the date
                        of this disclosure.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        If additional advertising or commercial arrangements
                        are introduced, we will make disclosures where
                        appropriate and update relevant website policies.
                        Compensation arrangements may differ across services
                        and should not be assumed to apply to every item
                        mentioned on the website.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section id="independence" class="scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">8. Editorial Independence and Reader Trust</h2>
                    <p class="mt-3 leading-7">
                        Our goal is to provide useful, practical information
                        that helps readers make informed household decisions.
                        We aim to keep product suitability and the availability
                        of affiliate compensation as separate considerations.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        A commission opportunity should not be treated as proof
                        that a product is superior, suitable, independently
                        tested, or right for your circumstances. Unless a
                        specific test or firsthand experience is clearly
                        described, do not assume that Findable Home has
                        personally purchased or tested a product.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        We cannot guarantee that every product or retailer
                        will meet every reader's expectations. We encourage
                        readers to compare options and review relevant
                        information before buying.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section id="third-parties" class="scroll-mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">9. Third-Party Websites and Privacy</h2>
                    <p class="mt-3 leading-7">
                        Clicking an affiliate link may take you to a retailer,
                        affiliate network, Benable, or another external
                        service. These services operate independently and
                        have their own terms, privacy policies, tracking
                        technologies, customer-service arrangements, and
                        transaction procedures.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        Findable Home does not control how third-party
                        services collect or use information. For details
                        about tracking, data collection, purchases, refunds,
                        or returns, review the relevant provider's policies.
                    </p>
                    <p class="mt-4 leading-7">
                        For information about our own website practices,
                        please read our
                        <a href="/privacy-policy/" class="link link-primary">Privacy Policy</a>.
                    </p>
                </section>

                <section id="contact" class="scroll-mt-6 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-primary/20 bg-primary/5 shadow-sm">
                    <div class="h-1.5 bg-primary"></div>
                    <div class="p-6 sm:p-8">
                        <span class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary">Questions about our links?</span>
                        <h2 class="mt-2 text-xl font-bold sm:text-2xl">10. Contact Us</h2>
                        <p class="mt-3 leading-7">
                            If you have questions about this Affiliate Disclosure
                            or a commercial relationship described on our website,
                            please contact Findable Home.
                        </p>
                        <div class="mt-5 rounded-xl border border-base-300 bg-base-100 p-5">
                            <p class="font-bold">Findable Home</p>
                            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-base-content/70">Email us at</p>
                            <a href="mailto:contact@findablehome.me" class="mt-1 inline-block break-all font-semibold text-primary underline underline-offset-4">
                                contact@findablehome.me
                            </a>
                            <p class="mt-3 text-sm">
                                <a href="https://findablehome.me/" class="link link-primary">findablehome.me</a>
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </section>

                <p class="px-1 py-3 text-center text-sm text-base-content/60">
                    Thank you for supporting thoughtful, practical household content.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>
</Layout>

